(7568753, 1214671, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gentle and endearing, fading into eternal kittenhood.  Wonderful image.</td>', 'Gentle and endearing, fading into eternal kittenhood.  Wonderful image.', '2018-05-19 15:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568754, 1214631, 173844, '<td valign="top">Compelling expression, nice pose and composition.  The yellow wall makes an interesting background.  Mesmerizing eyes.</td>', 'Compelling expression, nice pose and composition.  The yellow wall makes an interesting background.  Mesmerizing eyes.', '2018-05-19 15:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568755, 1214658, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sultry.  Now those are bedroom eyes.  Really lovely image.  The modestly high key treatment is in keeping with the overall elegance of the scene.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Sultry.  Now those are bedroom eyes.  Really lovely image.  The modestly high key treatment is in keeping with the overall elegance of the scene.  One of my favorites.', '2018-05-19 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568757, 1214683, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-caught, amusing pose.  The brightly lit ring of foliage set off by strong vignetting casts an air of mystery and drama.  Very interesting approach and result.</td>', 'Well-caught, amusing pose.  The brightly lit ring of foliage set off by strong vignetting casts an air of mystery and drama.  Very interesting approach and result.', '2018-05-19 16:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568760, 1214521, 173844, '<td valign="top">Classic pose, crisp composition.  The tonal modulations are fascinating, the use of grain enhances the overall timeless feel.  Handsome.</td>', 'Classic pose, crisp composition.  The tonal modulations are fascinating, the use of grain enhances the overall timeless feel.  Handsome.', '2018-05-19 16:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568778, 1214684, 173844, '<td valign="top">A look of steely determination, with eyes that seem to hold its environment within.  A good portrayal of intensity.</td>', 'A look of steely determination, with eyes that seem to hold its environment within.  A good portrayal of intensity.', '2018-05-20 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568781, 1214722, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stylish black and white study emphasizing texture and the simple, direct gaze.  Wonderfully minimal.</td>', 'Stylish black and white study emphasizing texture and the simple, direct gaze.  Wonderfully minimal.', '2018-05-20 00:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568783, 1214682, 173844, '<td valign="top">Curious pose and moment, but the setting and composition are happily harmonious.  It engages me more and more as I look at it.  Very fine.</td>', 'Curious pose and moment, but the setting and composition are happily harmonious.  It engages me more and more as I look at it.  Very fine.', '2018-05-20 00:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568794, 1214441, 173844, '<td valign="top">All the entries celebrate our appreciation of cats.  This is the only entry that shows their interaction with a person.  It beautifully, touchingly actually shows our appreciation, and maybe even a cat''s appreciation of us.  Can''t really know what the cat is feeling, but as the woman has her connection, and quite likely love, the whole is so much greater than the sum of the parts.  The tenderness is captivating.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'All the entries celebrate our appreciation of cats.  This is the only entry that shows their interaction with a person.  It beautifully, touchingly actually shows our appreciation, and maybe even a cat''s appreciation of us.  Can''t really know what the cat is feeling, but as the woman has her connection, and quite likely love, the whole is so much greater than the sum of the parts.  The tenderness is captivating.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-05-20 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568795, 1214740, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait nicely focused on the eyes.  I like the composition of the cat while thinking that the white portion of the background is slightly jarring, but what we''d like and what we have cannot be argued.  Black and white well serves these middle tones.  The expression is winning.</td>', 'Lovely portrait nicely focused on the eyes.  I like the composition of the cat while thinking that the white portion of the background is slightly jarring, but what we''d like and what we have cannot be argued.  Black and white well serves these middle tones.  The expression is winning.', '2018-05-20 09:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568796, 1214736, 173844, '<td valign="top">If this is a shoe box then this cat''s a size 16.  A great sprawl illustrating elegant inelegance.  Dreamy, creamy and satisfying.</td>', 'If this is a shoe box then this cat''s a size 16.  A great sprawl illustrating elegant inelegance.  Dreamy, creamy and satisfying.', '2018-05-20 09:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568797, 1214728, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  It seems a prison-like setting, and maybe the contrast with their natural innocence is intentional.  They also appear to be floating free of gravity.  It''s a fascinating and thought-provoking image.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  It seems a prison-like setting, and maybe the contrast with their natural innocence is intentional.  They also appear to be floating free of gravity.  It''s a fascinating and thought-provoking image.', '2018-05-20 09:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568798, 1214745, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great cat for a dark background, striking and almost discordant.  Amazing whiskers.  I had it rated higher but lowered it a notch because of the blown out blacks of the fur.  If that''s unfair, sorry.  Orange eyes that seize you deep inside.  Middle name suggestion:  Snidely.</td>', 'Great cat for a dark background, striking and almost discordant.  Amazing whiskers.  I had it rated higher but lowered it a notch because of the blown out blacks of the fur.  If that''s unfair, sorry.  Orange eyes that seize you deep inside.  Middle name suggestion:  Snidely.', '2018-05-20 09:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568799, 1214611, 173844, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught the look that melts an "owner''s" heart.  The image, or cropped image, speaks directly to this moment and the depth of focus is perfect.</td>', 'You''ve caught the look that melts an "owner''s" heart.  The image, or cropped image, speaks directly to this moment and the depth of focus is perfect.', '2018-05-20 09:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568800, 1214612, 173844, '<td valign="top">Are these cats or chinchillas?  Okay, they''re fake, but oh so cute.  If you''ve actually purchased all of these I either admire your dedication to your art or your, er, dedication...  In any case they''re a treat to see, and elicited a smile.</td>', 'Are these cats or chinchillas?  Okay, they''re fake, but oh so cute.  If you''ve actually purchased all of these I either admire your dedication to your art or your, er, dedication...  In any case they''re a treat to see, and elicited a smile.', '2018-05-20 09:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568802, 1214714, 173844, '<td valign="top">Oh man, what a beautiful animal.  You''ve done it justice, as it humbly meditates.  Nice composition and disposition of the foliage.</td>', 'Oh man, what a beautiful animal.  You''ve done it justice, as it humbly meditates.  Nice composition and disposition of the foliage.', '2018-05-20 09:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568803, 1214717, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s the moment of bliss.</td>', 'There''s the moment of bliss.', '2018-05-20 09:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568804, 1214472, 173844, '<td valign="top">How come I feel this cat knows me better than I know myself?  It''s immediacy, I suppose, and that penetrating gaze.  The color is the color, but what quiet subtlety, and what a fitting name.  Excellent close up portrayal.</td>', 'How come I feel this cat knows me better than I know myself?  It''s immediacy, I suppose, and that penetrating gaze.  The color is the color, but what quiet subtlety, and what a fitting name.  Excellent close up portrayal.', '2018-05-20 10:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568805, 1214737, 173844, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like a killer, but watch out mice.  The flash feels a bit unnatural, but he/she looks terrific in that beautiful setting.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like a killer, but watch out mice.  The flash feels a bit unnatural, but he/she looks terrific in that beautiful setting.', '2018-05-20 10:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568806, 1214746, 173844, '<td valign="top">Hard to believe that this lovely cat hasn''t a loving home, but rather enjoys wandering about like a movie idol.  The colors work well together and the ground in its natural appearance further advances the sense of nonchalance.  Such visits would feel, at least to me, as blessings.</td>', 'Hard to believe that this lovely cat hasn''t a loving home, but rather enjoys wandering about like a movie idol.  The colors work well together and the ground in its natural appearance further advances the sense of nonchalance.  Such visits would feel, at least to me, as blessings.', '2018-05-20 10:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568807, 1214741, 173844, '<td valign="top">The lines of this image have the feel of an arrow''s fletching, along which lies this handsome cat.  It''s interesting in that respect, but the gray coloration, in my opinion, is not becoming and doesn''t enhance the overall shape and dark color of this cat.  It''s busy and bland.  I''m sure a different background would really show off his/her beauty.</td>', 'The lines of this image have the feel of an arrow''s fletching, along which lies this handsome cat.  It''s interesting in that respect, but the gray coloration, in my opinion, is not becoming and doesn''t enhance the overall shape and dark color of this cat.  It''s busy and bland.  I''m sure a different background would really show off his/her beauty.', '2018-05-20 10:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568808, 1214716, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''m probably wrong, but this cat looks forlorn.  It''s pattern is certainly striking.  I like how it''s composed, yet feel that the background is somewhat busy.  There''s a story here that I wish I knew more about.</td>', 'I''m probably wrong, but this cat looks forlorn.  It''s pattern is certainly striking.  I like how it''s composed, yet feel that the background is somewhat busy.  There''s a story here that I wish I knew more about.', '2018-05-20 10:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568809, 1214742, 173844, '<td valign="top">Guessing this image is taken in a zoo.  It''s a beautiful animal and the pose shows off its elegance well.</td>', 'Guessing this image is taken in a zoo.  It''s a beautiful animal and the pose shows off its elegance well.', '2018-05-20 10:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568810, 1214727, 173844, '<td valign="top">Try as I might, just can''t figure out what''s going on here.  I''ll bet it''s worthwhile, but that''s all I''ll hazard.</td>', 'Try as I might, just can''t figure out what''s going on here.  I''ll bet it''s worthwhile, but that''s all I''ll hazard.', '2018-05-20 10:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568811, 1214711, 173844, '<td valign="top">A strange and interesting image that''s processed to make the cat''s coat look patchy and faceted.  Is that a forest on its forehead?  I really like the murky colors of the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'A strange and interesting image that''s processed to make the cat''s coat look patchy and faceted.  Is that a forest on its forehead?  I really like the murky colors of the bottom of the photo.', '2018-05-20 10:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568812, 1214611, 61396, '<td valign="top">up close and personal</td>', 'up close and personal', '2018-05-20 10:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568813, 1214633, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not meant as a criticism, the entire image is kind of jittery, which then pulls back into abstraction, or at least that''s how I see it.  I like the overall dreamy feel to it, but I don''t know if anyone else sees it so.</td>', 'Not meant as a criticism, the entire image is kind of jittery, which then pulls back into abstraction, or at least that''s how I see it.  I like the overall dreamy feel to it, but I don''t know if anyone else sees it so.', '2018-05-20 10:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568814, 1214670, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is a take that I can''t say I go for, but I applaud your willingness to explore and experiment.</td>', 'This is a take that I can''t say I go for, but I applaud your willingness to explore and experiment.', '2018-05-20 10:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
